	(text "9. Datasheet: https://www.nxp.com/docs/en/data-sheet/PCF8563.pdf"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 54.61 130.556 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(href "https://www.nxp.com/docs/en/data-sheet/PCF8563.pdf")
		)
		(uuid "b0d56aa7-a3d9-4747-ad5e-2241909cfe51")
	)
	(text "BMS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b791b694-310b-41f8-b7f3-ded990977a77")
	)
	(text "Notes to self:\n1. After power-on, the initial accuracy can be adjusted by testing the output frequency of CLKOUT and adjusting the matching capacitor value of the OSCI pin. If CLKOUT > 32.768kHz, the OSCI capacitor value needs to be increased;\nif CLKOUT < 32.768kHz, the capacitor value needs to be decreased.\n\n2. Generally, if using a 32.768kHz crystal oscillator with a load capacitor of 12.5pF, approximately a 25pF matching capacitor needs to be connected to the OSCI pin to adjust the initial accuracy. Also added C7 on OSCO. Final values TBD\n\n3. If noise or interference signals occur on the VDD power line, it is recommendedby the RTC chip mfr to add resistors and capacitors to the power line for filtering. Currently C1 is the filter cap for the Swadge 3v3.\n\n4. Crystal requirements from RTC datasheet: f = 32.768 kHz, CL = 12.5 pF, ESR = 50-100k\n\n5. Probably just shorting C2, but need to test note 2 so I kept the symbol and footprint there\n\n6. I added a 500mA PTC fuse to test some short circuit protections. \n\n7. I2C addresses:\n		PCF8563	= 0x51\n		AW32001 = 0x49\n\nSet NTC to DISABLE; this is not the default setting for this chip. TH1 = DNP, R1 = 0, R2 = DNP.\n\n8. This will not back-power the Swadge via 3v3. The BMS does not have regulated 3.3V output on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.066 106.172 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ba4a63d7-6b49-4450-adae-b88d5dc2b053")
	)
	(text "Switching between 3v3 input and BMS input.\nI put it here to isolate the whole BMS circuit from the RTC eval circuit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 138.938 18.796 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ca6ae9cc-424f-4633-8ebc-019a71239656")
	)
	(text "Not sure if we need C7 yet, C8 added for testing"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 51.816 76.708 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dca94ead-df71-48af-871b-d36c2b8bcc90")
	)
